---
description: Tests must be written in English
globs: "**/*.{test,spec,integration}.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use English in `describe`/`it`, assertions, mock/fixture labels, placeholders, and mocked user-facing/error text.
- Use English mock translations and `getByText`/`findByText` values; backend specs should mock `I18nService` to return English.
- Locale strings are allowed only when the test explicitly verifies i18n behavior; prefer asserting keys when possible.
- API contract tests should assert English field names and response structure rather than localized message literals.
